mapping "W417.1" source="W417" target="88817006" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W417 SNOMED CT 88817006 is the Swedish national extension of ICD-10 W41 (Exposure to
        high-pressure jet) scoped to an agricultural place. Target =, the Athena crosswalk target for
        parent W41 (OMOP concept 45756294 -> 4230638). The target fully subsumes every clinical meaning
        of the source (a high-pressure jet exposure on a farm IS an exposure to inanimate mechanical
        force); the place/activity context is administrative detail with no SNOMED CT representation. High
        tier : one-level broader, crosswalk-verified on the parent code.
        """
}
